WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.668
What's this one?

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:04.129
It's Sergio Montoya's The Kiss.

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:05.797
It's a copy though.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:08.341
He's the painter I look up to most.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.886
His works are the only ones
I can't copy exactly.

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:16.391
It looks simple, but it's deep.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.228
Did you invite me
because I resemble this painting?

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:23.398
No, it's a more simple reason.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:27.152
I've been in a slump for a while
and couldn't paint.

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:31.197
But at that cafe,

00:00:31.281 --> 00:00:34.993
I felt like I could finally paint
when I saw you.

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:40.832
What should I do?

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:42.709
Sit over there.

